    <statement><p>Let <m>f(x) = 7 \csc x</m>.  Find the requested
derivatives.</p>
<p><m>f'(x) =</m><fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>f''(x) =</m><fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-7\csc\mathopen{}\left(x\right)\cot\mathopen{}\left(x\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7\mathopen{}\left(\csc^{3}\mathopen{}\left(x\right)+\csc\mathopen{}\left(x\right)\cot^{2}\mathopen{}\left(x\right)\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



<me>\begin{array}{rcl}
   f'(x) \amp =\amp  -7 \csc x \cot x \\
   f''(x) \amp =\amp  0a\big( (\csc x)(-\csc^2 x) + (-\csc x \cot x)(\cot x)\big) \\
   \amp =\amp  7( \csc^3 x + \csc x \cot^2 x)
  \end{array}</me>


</solution>
